// Eraser flowchart source. Paste into an Eraser diagram (Flow chart).
direction right

Image [shape: oval, label: "Product image"]
Embed [shape: rectangle, label: "SigLIP embedding"]
Scale [shape: rectangle, label: "Logits / temperature, softmax"]
Set [shape: rectangle, label: "Add classes until mass reaches q"]
One [shape: diamond, label: "One label in the set?"]
Auto [shape: oval, label: "Auto-tag"]
Review [shape: oval, label: "Review: choose from the set"]

Image > Embed > Scale > Set > One
One > Auto: yes
One > Review: no
